# DigitalGuardian area 53 (Sanctuary Fortress 09_cliff_temple_dark): the guardian's layers (3
# and 11) hold the body (u054e) and the head module (u051b); both are woken, the body gets
# the "XRDG" message (fn_14_5644), the player morphs (fn_14_38BC's morphed arm) and the head
# is deleted at the end (fn_14_11EA8 and fn_14_11F7C).
@f30 layer 3
@f60 layer 11
@f100 objs Guardian
@f140 send u054e Activate; send u051b Activate
@f400 objs Guardian
@f900 send u054e ResistedDamage
@f910 send u054e ResistedDamage
@f1300 press x 30
@f1400 boost
@f1600 objs Guardian
@f2000 objs Guardian
@f2400 send u051b Delete
